<title>BELGIUM: Liberals choose candidates for elections.</title>
<headline>Liberals choose candidates for elections.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Parliament's Liberal Group has proposed Danish deputy Bertel Haarder as its candidate for a vice presidency of the European Parliament.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it would also put forward Belgian Willy De Clercq as chairman of the Committee for Legal Affairs.</p>
<p>Dutchman Gijs De Vries was confirmed in a unanimous vote as leader of the group.</p>
</text>
